{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "d1e6af74-33e3-8ebf-93e0-dacb1b3b9da8",
  "created_at": "2026-01-26T17:51:14-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Samir Patel",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T17:47:59-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Lorraine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T17:48:02-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, a real person. Okay, good. I figured I'd get a recording, calling this late. It's nice to hear a voice that's not a machine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T17:48:12-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, the storm line stays staffed after City Hall closes, so you've got me. What can I help you with?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T17:48:20-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So, I'm calling for my mother. The plow came through and knocked over her mailbox. Just flattened it, the post is leaning over in the snowbank."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T17:48:30-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, I'm sorry about that. Let me get the location. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T17:48:36-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 194 Broadway. North End, up toward the, uh, the stretch past the school. Her side is the even side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T17:48:44-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 194 Broadway. And it's the mailbox and the post both that came down?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T17:48:50-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, the whole thing. Box is on the ground, post snapped at the bottom. Oh, and by the way, the snow they pushed up at the end of her driveway is pretty heavy too, wet stuff, because of the rain at the end. But I'm calling about the mailbox first."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T17:49:09-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, understood. So the plow hit it during the storm that came in Sunday and finished up today, is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T17:49:17-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, it started Sunday, turned to rain, and it was done this afternoon. I only got over there after work, around five, and that's when I saw it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T17:49:28-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. I'll write that up as a plow damage report, mailbox knocked over at 194 Broadway, found this evening. Do you want me to note the driveway snowbank too?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T17:49:40-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You can note it, but the mailbox is the thing. She's in her eighties and the mail carrier needs somewhere to put it. So when will it be cleared, or, I mean, fixed? When does somebody come look at it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T17:49:55-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The report goes to the supervisor tomorrow morning, and somebody typically looks at these within a few days after a storm. I'd say expect to hear something this week. Can I get a callback number in case they need to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T17:50:11-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 401-555-0155. That's my cell, not hers. She doesn't always pick up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T17:50:17-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 401-555-0155. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T17:50:20-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Samir Patel."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T17:50:22-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Mr. Patel. Let me read it back. Mailbox and post knocked over by a plow, 194 Broadway, North End, reported Monday evening after the snow-to-rain storm, callback to you at 401-555-0155. Did I get it right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T17:50:36-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. Oh, one more thing. Should I take a picture of it? Before I stand it back up or whatever."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T17:50:44-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's a good idea. Take a photo of the box and the post as they are now, and hold on to it. If someone calls you, you'll have it handy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T17:50:56-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'll do that tonight. And I'll leave it lying there for now so it's like it was."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T17:51:03-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That works. Anything else I can do for you this evening?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T17:51:08-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Thanks for picking up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T17:51:11-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Take care, Mr. Patel."
    }
  ],
